<title>USA: United Waste Systems Inc Q3 net rose.</title>
<headline>United Waste Systems Inc Q3 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter		 Nine Months</p>
<p>			 1996     1995	     1996	1995</p>
<p> Revenues   $90,046,875 $63,323,382 $241,884,894 $160,289,684</p>
<p>Poolings-of-interests</p>
<p>    expenses  2,532,657     900,000    5,256,011	900,000</p>
<p>Loss on transfer station and other one-time</p>
<p>    charges     102,135	    --    2,499,087	     --</p>
<p> Net income  11,392,858   8,729,243   23,813,167   18,394,654</p>
<p>Primary earnings per</p>
<p>    share	    0.29	  0.24	   0.60	   0.54</p>
<p>Fully diluted earnings per</p>
<p>    share	    0.28	  0.24	   0.59	   0.53</p>
<p>Primary average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding39,968,150  36,606,519   39,453,530   33,973,901</p>
<p>NOTES: Pretax poolings-of-interests expenses and one-time charges had a combined per share impact of $0.05 vs $0.01 in quarter and $0.15 vs $0.02 in nine months.</p>
<p>1995 results restated to reflect the pooling-of-interests with Salinas Disposal Service, Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
